// Title: UAC Bypass Using IEInstal - File
// Rule ID: bdd8157d-8e85-4397-bb82-f06cc9c71dbb
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
